    "description": {
      "summary": "You create a very small, immobile illusion of any object, force, or creature you visualize",
      "value": "<p>You create a very small, immobile illusion of any object, force, or creature you visualize. The illusion does not create sound, smell, texture, or temperature, nor does it move. The resulting illusion matches your visualization exactly, even if the image in your mind differs somehow from the real object, force, or creature—if such exists at all.</p>"
